Since April, people have told us their bookings land on the wrong day. The export contains
**412 unique reports** merged into this ticket by 4 October.

The original entry treated this as one parser bug with one queued fix. The current knowledge-base
model groups the reports into two working causes and leaves five flagged records unresolved.
See the [cause review](/kb/incidents/4471/causes) before using the original diagnosis.

<Callout kind="warn">
Known ticket; cause and fix coverage have not been independently verified for every report.
